; Shape Propagation : LogicalAdd — POSITIVELY GATED on the operands'
; shapes being ONE CLASS already (?shape binds both premises): propagation
; waits for the equality proof instead of optimistically setting both and
; letting :no-merge panic on PENDING-equal classes (user ruling
; 2026-07-23; the duplicative-set tripwire is legal only for ATOM-valued
; functions like dtype, whose values can never become equal later).
; Fail-open: operands whose shapes are never proven equal propagate no
; shape, stay unimplementable, and fail loudly at extraction.
(rule
  (
    (= ?out_logical (LogicalAdd ?in1_logical ?in2_logical))
    (= ?shape (shape-of ?in1_logical))
    (= ?shape (shape-of ?in2_logical))
  )
  (
    (set (shape-of ?out_logical) ?shape)
  )
  :ruleset prop
)
